date-released: "2026-05-01"
url: "https://github.com/Heeeeeeliang/Applying-Deep-Time-Series-Learning-to-Stock-Forecasting-and-Quant-Trading"
abstract: >
  A three-layer cascaded task decomposition framework for equity forecasting,
  built on the empirical finding that direct price-direction prediction hits a
  systematic ~50% accuracy ceiling across nine baseline methods under strict
  no-leakage evaluation. Layer 1 predicts realised volatility (LightGBM);
  Layer 2 localises turning points (MultiScaleCNN with meta-labelling);
  Layer 3 filters trades. Backtested on 8 NASDAQ tickers, 2020–2022.
